# Keep internal files off the public Vercel deployment — only the website is published.
# Leading slashes anchor each entry to the project root: Vercel matches these case-insensitively,
# so an unanchored "Logo.svg" would also drop assets/img/logo.svg.
/AMI_Brand_Guidelines_2026_DIGITAL.pdf.pdf
/Logo.svg
/README.md
/serve.ps1
/start-server.bat
/.claude
